    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i actually had a tetanus shot a few years ago so i think i'm probably good on that front. i'm just really worried about it getting infected or anything. if i use a lot of antibiotic ointment and keep it covered with a bandage, is that basically the same thing as what a doctor would do? i really just want to avoid the waiting room if possible.",
